      ],
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "Here's a common myth.",
          "from": 10,
          "to": 56
        },
        {
          "text": "People think a transformer looks",
          "from": 59,
          "to": 107
        },
        {
          "text": "up answers in a stored",
          "from": 108,
          "to": 154
        },
        {
          "text": "database of facts.",
          "from": 156,
          "to": 205
        },
        {
          "text": "It doesn't.",
          "from": 208,
          "to": 237
        },
        {
          "text": "Its knowledge is spread across",
          "from": 239,
          "to": 286
        },
        {
          "text": "billions of parameters,",
          "from": 289,
          "to": 332
        },
        {
          "text": "as patterns.",
          "from": 335,
          "to": 374
        },
        {
          "text": "That's why it can be",
          "from": 376,
          "to": 398
        },
        {
          "text": "brilliant, and also why it",
          "from": 400,
          "to": 448
        },
        {
          "text": "can confidently get facts wrong.",
          "from": 450,
          "to": 518
        }
      ],
